SUMMARY:Taylor Swift Cardio Kickboxing Class
DESCRIPTION:Taylor-Inspired Cardio Kickboxing\nHit Hard. Sing Loud. Feel Fearless.\nReady to shake off stress\, sweat to your favorite hits\, and leave feeling unstoppable?\nJoin us for a high-energy cardio kickboxing experience inspired by the music and eras we all know and love. No martial arts experience is required—just bring your energy and get ready for an unforgettable workout.\nYour ticket includes:\n-Boxing gloves to keep\n-A 45–60 minute instructor-led cardio kickboxing class\n-A Taylor-inspired playlist\n-A fun\, welcoming atmosphere for all fitness levels\n-A workout focused on confidence\, movement\, and having a great time\nWhether you’re a longtime fan or simply looking for a unique fitness experience\, this class is designed to help you move\, sweat\, sing\, and leave feeling fearless.\nDate: Monday\, August 3 Time: 7:00 PM – 8:00 PM Location: Strike Martial Arts 101 W Main St\, Durham\, NC\nPrice: $50 per person (includes your own pair of boxing gloves)\nSpace is limited. Reserve your spot today
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/taylor-swift-cardio-kickboxing-class/
LOCATION:Durham (various sites)\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Fitness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Taylor-Swift-1.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Strike Martial Arts":MAILTO:ryan@strikema.com
GEO:35.850295;-79.023205
END:VEVENT
