SUMMARY:The Winks & Rouge Cabaret Burlesque and Drag Open Stage
DESCRIPTION:Ready to unleash your inhibitions with a tantalizing twist burlesque and drag? Get ready for a night where desires ignite and fantasies come to life on our diverse\, inclusive and queer friendly stage.\nFrom seasoned performers to fresh faces\, we offer variety\, diversity\, and creativity for all. New to burlesque shows? This is the perfect place to start! \nJoin us every first Thursday for a rendezvous where the daring and thrill seekers come to play. Here\, tease is an art form\, slow burn earns a new meaning\, and every movement tells a story\, even if it’s just “I’m Hot\, look at me!”.\nIt’s more than a stage; it’s community\, love\, and unity! \nExperience the art of tease and transformation as performers express themselves through their art. From seasoned artists with over a decade of experience to fresh faces just starting out\, our stage celebrates variety\, diversity\, creativity and our doors are open to all styles\, types\, genders\, and bodies. This is where you want to be on a Thursday night! \nPrepare to be seduced by a variety of talent in this show. Lose yourself in the intoxicating allure of Winks and Rouge Cabaret. \nA 21+ EVENT\nDoors at 7:30pm\, Show at 8pm\nTickts $13 Advance\, $15 at Door
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/the-winks-rouge-cabaret-burlesque-and-drag-open-stage/
LOCATION:Durty Bull Brewing Company\, 206 Broadway Street\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults Only,Brewery,Dance,LGBTQ,Live Performance
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/winksaug.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Winks &amp%3B Rouge Cabaret":MAILTO:lady.giallo.nc@gmail.com
GEO:36.0011419;-78.8983227
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Durty Bull Brewing Company 206 Broadway Street Durham NC 27701 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=206 Broadway Street:geo:-78.8983227,36.0011419
END:VEVENT
